{"ID":"20240206111252-km3agcr","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240206111252-km3agcr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111252-km3agcr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111309-u8xmqez\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613161103-v8o188n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240703111543-gdafbvj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"336蛇蜕","type":"doc","updated":"20240827175553"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206111309-u8xmqez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111309-u8xmqez","updated":"20240206111312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】\t游蛇科动物黑眉锦蛇Elaphe taeniura Cope、锦蛇Elaphe carinata (Guenther) 或乌梢蛇Zaocys dhumnades (Cantor) 等蜕下的干燥表皮膜。春末夏初或冬初采集，除去泥沙，干燥。\n【产地】\t全国大部分地区均产。\n【性状】\t本品呈圆筒形，多压扁而皱缩，完整者形似蛇，长可达1m以上。背部银灰色或淡灰棕色，有光泽，鳞迹菱形或椭圆形，衔接处呈白色，略抽皱或凹下；腹部乳白色或略显黄色，鳞迹长方形，呈覆瓦状排列。体轻，质微韧，手捏有润滑感和弹性，轻轻搓揉，沙沙作响。气微腥，味淡或微咸。\n【性味】\t甘、咸，平。\n【功效】\t祛风，定惊，解毒，退翳。用于小儿惊风，抽搐痉挛，翳障，喉痹，疔肿，皮肤瘙痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240206111301-3sdsvfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111301-3sdsvfn","updated":"20240206111301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206111301-tm5u98j.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240827175518-adsfez9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240827175518-adsfez9","updated":"20240827175553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 616px;","style":"width: 606px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛇蜕"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛇蜕-20240827175518-wnfeopk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 606px;\" parent-style=\"width: 616px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 631px;","style":"width: 621px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛇蜕 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛇蜕 1-20240827175553-mdbq0qu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 621px;\" parent-style=\"width: 631px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240703112223-n406lyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703112223-n406lyj","updated":"20240827175656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 523px;","style":"width: 513px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛇蜕3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛇蜕3-20240703112414-uvbxx2p.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 513px;\" parent-style=\"width: 523px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 724px;","style":"width: 714px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛇蜕 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛇蜕 2-20240827175638-k504tps.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 714px;\" parent-style=\"width: 724px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240703111340-c82dlz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703111340-c82dlz8","updated":"20240827175654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 658px;","style":"width: 648px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"锦蛇2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/锦蛇2-20240703111559-ksaqnnl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 648px;\" parent-style=\"width: 658px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 610px;","style":"width: 600px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"锦蛇5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/锦蛇5-20240703111933-v1lafwr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 600px;\" parent-style=\"width: 610px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240703111559-ptzanez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703111559-ptzanez","updated":"20240827175652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 707px;","style":"width: 697px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌梢蛇"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乌梢蛇-20240703111824-cbe143g.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 697px;\" parent-style=\"width: 707px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 574px;","style":"width: 564px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌梢蛇3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乌梢蛇3-20240703111827-gqkf7za.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 564px;\" parent-style=\"width: 574px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240613161102-qr3dqib","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161102-qr3dqib"}},{"ID":"20240613161501-q4ldanm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161501-q4ldanm","updated":"20240613161505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161501-lme8flz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161501-lme8flz","updated":"20240613161501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸平。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161501-mh8t4q0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161501-mh8t4q0","updated":"20240613161501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主小儿百二十种惊痫，葜疭、瘨疾，寒热，肠痔，虫毒，蛇痫。火熬之良。一名龙子衣，一名蛇符，一名龙子单衣，一名弓皮。生川谷及田野。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161501-c5lc61v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161501-c5lc61v","updated":"20240613161501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：蛇蜕，一名龙子单衣，一名弓皮，一名蛇附，一名蛇筋，一名龙皮，一名龙单衣（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161501-3x830zb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161501-3x830zb","updated":"20240613161501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名龙子皮，生荆州，五月五日，十五日、取之良。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161501-l0z8ilp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161501-l0z8ilp","updated":"20240613161501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：它，虫也，从虫而长，象冤，曲尾形，或作蛇蜕，蛇蝉所解皮也。《广雅》云：蝮蜟蜕也。《中山经》云：来山多空夺。郭璞云：即蛇皮脱也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161513-gqnmevp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161513-gqnmevp"}},{"ID":"20240613161515-117qouc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161515-117qouc","updated":"20240613161519"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《玉楸药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161515-g63urn2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161515-g63urn2","updated":"20240613161515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，气平，入手太阴肺经。发表驱风，退瞖败毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161515-m1f63e6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161515-m1f63e6","updated":"20240613161515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕发散皮毛，治疮疡毒肿。至于退瞖膜，止惊痫，则非蛇蜕、蝉蜕所能奏效。庸工往往不解病源，而但用表散之品，可见庸陋极矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161545-xdz2oxj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161545-xdz2oxj"}},{"ID":"20240613161547-ghhew1h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161547-ghhew1h","updated":"20240613161551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161547-f19t4l5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161547-f19t4l5","updated":"20240613161547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘咸．入手太阴经．功专发表驱风．退翳败毒．治惊痫风疟．重舌．鬼魅蛊毒．喉风疥疮．疮肿痔漏．产难目翳．小儿口紧不能开合．烧灰敷良．或酒或醋．或蜜浸炙黄．或烧存性．或盐泥固 ．得当归治缠喉风．得蝉蜕铁落头发．治产难不下．"}]},{"ID":"20240613161652-1w8bytc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161652-1w8bytc"}},{"ID":"20240613161653-0aaeu7o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161653-0aaeu7o","updated":"20240613161658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161653-kjk1gpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161653-kjk1gpf","updated":"20240613161653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《心》云∶去翳膜用之，取其意也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161653-az02awj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161653-az02awj","updated":"20240613161653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《日华子》云∶止呕逆，小儿惊悸客忤，催生。 疡、白癜风，煎汁敷。入药炙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161638-vakepqw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161638-vakepqw"}},{"ID":"20240613161639-hvte8ll","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161639-hvte8ll","updated":"20240613161644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《本草简要方》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161639-wiq01je","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161639-wiq01je","updated":"20240613161639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治。祛风毒。退目翳。小儿各种惊痫。大人五邪。言语僻越。止呕逆。安胎。催生。煎汁洗敷疔肿疮。及诸恶虫伤。蛇蜕丹。蛇蜕（）潮脑枯矾雄黄油核桃花椒（焙）各五分。水银槟榔各一钱五分。杏仁大枫肉各二十一枚。研末。陈蜡烛油为丸。每早手搓鼻嗅。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161639-f785ql3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161639-f785ql3","updated":"20240613161639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治疥疮。蛇蜕散。乌蛇蜕一条。蝉蜕十四枚。血余一握。（胎发）烧灰存性。研末。分三服。温酒调连进之。治倒产。又方。蛇蜕（炙）当归各等分。研末温酒服一钱。取吐。治缠喉。风气闭。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161628-8hi9iwj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161628-8hi9iwj"}},{"ID":"20240613161630-t508fco","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161630-t508fco","updated":"20240613161633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161630-9j9i63k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161630-9j9i63k","updated":"20240613161630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘咸，性灵善窜，祛风杀虫，治顽癣恶疮，产难目翳。酒炙、醋炙任用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161720-pieh2jj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161720-pieh2jj"}},{"ID":"20240613161721-sjlaanr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161721-sjlaanr","updated":"20240613161725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161721-vwzqu3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161721-vwzqu3g","updated":"20240613161721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸、甘，平，无毒。主小儿百二十种惊痫，螈 ，癫疾，寒热，肠痔，虫毒，蛇痫，弄舌摇头，大人五邪，言语僻越，恶疮，呕咳，明目。火熬之良。一名龙子衣，一名蛇符，一名龙子皮，一名龙子单衣，一名弓皮。生荆州川谷及田野。五月五日、十五日取之，良。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161721-fgd6jiq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161721-fgd6jiq","updated":"20240613161721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"畏磁石及酒。草中不甚见虺、蝮蜕，惟有长者，多是赤练、黄颔辈，其皮不可复识，今往往得尔，皆须完全。石上者弥佳，烧之甚疗诸恶疮也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161618-eei3qez","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161618-eei3qez"}},{"ID":"20240613161619-4gdqica","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161619-4gdqica","updated":"20240613161624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161619-t956i63","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161619-t956i63","updated":"20240613161619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得火良。畏磁石及酒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161619-4euuna1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161619-4euuna1","updated":"20240613161619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸、甘、平。有毒。除风疟，祛翳膜，治螈 ，杀三虫，疗疮疥，止呕逆，愈肠痔，定惊痫。配当归，治缠喉风。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161619-czq8zlb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161619-czq8zlb","updated":"20240613161619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"配花粉、羊肝，治痘后目翳。调人乳，治小儿咳吐血。调猪颊车髓，涂小儿解颅。烧存性，研末，治耳忽大痛。（如有虫在内奔走，痛不可忍，以鹅翎吹之立愈。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161619-10zoime","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161619-10zoime","updated":"20240613161619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青黄色者不入药，白色者佳。皂荚水洗净，缠竹上，或酒，或醋，或蜜浸，炙黄用。或盐泥固 ，或烧炭存性，随症制用。产妇禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161607-3ur6bzv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161607-3ur6bzv"}},{"ID":"20240613161608-tpwhat6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161608-tpwhat6","updated":"20240613161613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161608-gjvdo9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161608-gjvdo9e","updated":"20240613161608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（龙）辟恶杀蛊解毒"}]},{"ID":"20240613161608-punb7r8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161608-punb7r8","updated":"20240613161608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕（专入肝。兼行皮肤）。味甘而咸。气平无毒。凡治小儿惊痫风毒等症。无不用此为主。盖此具有四能。一则性善辟恶。而凡邪魅蛊毒者不敢近。以其饮风吸露。气极清虚故也。二则性能。而凡惊痫癫仆。偏正头风。喉舌诸疾者皆能除。以其性极走窜。力能故也。三则性能杀蛊。而凡恶毒痔漏疥癣。无不用之即效。以其此属毒物。以毒攻毒故也。四则能去皮肤之疾。而凡眼目翳膜。胎衣不下。得此即为解脱。以其气以类聚。即从其类以除也。色白如银者佳。皂次。水洗净。或酒或醋。或蜜浸炙黄。或烧灰存性。或盐泥固。各随本方。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161557-g24lkyl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161557-g24lkyl"}},{"ID":"20240613161558-4gfiyf8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161558-4gfiyf8","updated":"20240613161603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161558-4d536fs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161558-4d536fs","updated":"20240613161558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘咸而毒，性窜善去风，能杀虫辟恶，皂荚水洗炙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161534-vlgifts","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161534-vlgifts"}},{"ID":"20240613161535-z8rntjr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161535-z8rntjr","updated":"20240613161539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161535-ly21beh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161535-ly21beh","updated":"20240613161535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸甘平小毒。火熬用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161535-jd58ajj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161535-jd58ajj","updated":"20240613161535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主小儿二十种惊痫，蛇痫，癫疾螈 ，弄舌摇头，寒热肠痔，蛊毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161535-qfkqywz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161535-qfkqywz","updated":"20240613161535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕属巽走肝，故《本经》治小儿惊痫等病，一皆风毒袭于经中之象。其入药有四义，一能辟恶取其性灵也，故治邪辟鬼魅，蛊疟诸疾。二能驱风取其性窜也，故治惊痫瘢驳，偏正头风，喉舌诸疾。三能杀虫，故治恶疮痔漏，疥癣诸疾，用其毒也。四有蜕义，故治眼目翳膜，胎衣不下，皮肤之疾，会意以从其类也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161525-nryda11","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161525-nryda11"}},{"ID":"20240613161526-cqqrct5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161526-cqqrct5","updated":"20240613161530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161526-gw1wrak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161526-gw1wrak","updated":"20240613161526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸平。主小儿百二十种惊痫。螈。疾。寒热。肠痔。虫毒。蛇痫。火熬之良。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161526-sxignkr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161526-sxignkr","updated":"20240613161526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名龙子衣。一名蛇符。一名龙子单衣。一名弓皮。生川谷及田野。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161526-aqo9w64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161526-aqo9w64","updated":"20240613161526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"似之而非。它虫灵蜕。雪电藏形。风雷偃势。蚓蚁失乘。蛆残噬。凡骨登仙。饱餐脱滞。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161526-lx3hy4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161526-lx3hy4t","updated":"20240613161526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"庄子。蛇蜕也。似之而非也。说文。它从虫而长。郭璞赞。灵蜕乘烟。白居易赋。鳞甲晶以雪色。睛眸其电光。李绅诗。已应蜕骨风雷后。韩非子。云罢雾霁。龙蛇与蚓蚁同矣。则失其所乘也。关尹子。蛆食蛇。陆游诗。凡骨已蜕身自轻。夏侯湛序。弃俗登仙。尔雅翼。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161526-fxj8r8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161526-fxj8r8x","updated":"20240613161526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草居。恒饥。每得食稍饱。辄蜕壳。避暑录话。神仙升举。形滞难脱。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161102-qe7wslt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161102-qe7wslt"}},{"ID":"20240613161447-phzrufr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161447-phzrufr","updated":"20240613161452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《本草易读》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161447-6h94tt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161447-6h94tt2","updated":"20240613161447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"皂角水洗净，烧用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161447-lv82gze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161447-lv82gze","updated":"20240613161447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘，咸，有小毒。除一切恶疮惊痫肿毒，杀诸般邪魅蛊虫恶气。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161447-9j6iyrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161447-9j6iyrt","updated":"20240613161447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"耳忽大痛，烧末吹之，立止。（验方第一。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161447-lst39uy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161447-lst39uy","updated":"20240613161447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生产横逆，烧末酒下，立顺。（第二。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161400-iekfo4a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161400-iekfo4a"}},{"ID":"20240613161422-024ke1l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161422-024ke1l","updated":"20240613161426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161422-2sr87oq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161422-2sr87oq","updated":"20240613161422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"轻，宣，去风毒"}]},{"ID":"20240613161422-dzus2ja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161422-dzus2ja","updated":"20240613161422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘咸无毒（甄权∶有毒）。性灵而能辟恶，故治鬼魅蛊毒；性窜而善去风，故治惊痫风疟，重舌（《圣惠方》∶烧末敷）喉风；性毒而能杀虫，故治疥癣恶疮，疔肿痔漏；属皮而性善蜕，故治皮肤疮疡，产难目翳。用白色如银者，皂荚水洗净。或酒、或醋、或蜜浸，炙黄用，或烧存性，或盐泥固 ，各随本方。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161400-k269zkd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161400-k269zkd"}},{"ID":"20240613161413-8mgv6mm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161413-8mgv6mm","updated":"20240613161417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161413-h7kr0sr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161413-h7kr0sr","updated":"20240613161413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其蜕无时。但着不净即蜕。或大饱亦蜕。（颂）从口退出。眼睛亦退。（宗）味咸甘。气平。火熬之良。治喉风。退目翳。消木舌。诸恶疮似癞癜风白驳。（煎汁涂之）取其退为用者。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161413-o0cohan","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161413-o0cohan","updated":"20240613161413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当归。等小儿口噤不石痈无脓。坚个。头发一握〔论〕蛇治风证。如狂痫等疾。惟属阳实者。至阳虚则断非所宜。若患于湿以为风者。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161413-i6oh4e8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161413-i6oh4e8","updated":"20240613161413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是分皆其病于阴血之风而患在表分者。用之为最切耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161413-u95xk7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161413-u95xk7w","updated":"20240613161413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凡小儿惊痫癫疾。非外邪客忤而由于肝心虚者。不效。（仲淳）孕妇忌用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161413-msydq1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161413-msydq1h","updated":"20240613161413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕凡使勿用青黄苍色者。只用白色如银者。（雷公）先以皂荚水洗净。缠竹上。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161400-4oyj9hc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161400-4oyj9hc"}},{"ID":"20240613161401-g5pfz5v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161401-g5pfz5v","updated":"20240613161406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161401-4zbrwk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161401-4zbrwk2","updated":"20240613161401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味咸甘平，无毒。主治小儿百二十种惊痫，蛇痫，癫疾，螈 ，弄舌摇头，寒热肠痔，蛊毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161401-a628uws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161401-a628uws","updated":"20240613161401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（蛇蜕人家墙屋木石间多有之，其蜕无时，但着不净则蜕，或大饱亦蜕。凡青黄苍色者勿用，须白色如银者良，于五月五日蜕者更佳。又，蕲州之白花蛇，龙头虎口黑质，白花者，其蜕尤佳。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161401-d80kngv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161401-d80kngv","updated":"20240613161401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕色白如银，至洁至净，气味咸平，禀金水之气化，金能制风，故主治小儿百二十种惊痫，蛇痫之证。癫疾螈 ，惊痫病也。弄舌摇头，蛇痫病也。水能清热解毒，故主治大人寒热肠痔蛊毒。寒热者，肠痔蛊毒之寒热也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161401-ywrxyr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161401-ywrxyr1","updated":"20240613161401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"愚按∶痫证唯一，即曰∶惊痫。复曰∶蛇痫，则痫证不止一端，若以内之七情，外之形象求之，不啻百二十种，先圣立言，当意会也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161102-729lodl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161102-729lodl"}},{"ID":"20240613161344-7nivdo6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161344-7nivdo6","updated":"20240613161353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161344-37thol7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161344-37thol7","updated":"20240613161344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸甘，平，无毒。主小儿百二十种惊痫，螈 癫疾，寒热肠痔，蛊毒蛇痫，弄舌摇头，大人五邪，言语僻越，恶疮，呕咳，明目。《药性论》云∶臣。有毒。能主百鬼魅，治喉痹。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161344-rdrdkfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161344-rdrdkfy","updated":"20240613161344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日华子云∶治蛊毒，辟恶，止呕逆，治小儿惊悸客忤，催生， 疡，白癜风。煎汁敷，入药并炙用。畏∶磁石及酒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161102-wn1d90u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161102-wn1d90u"}},{"ID":"20240613161333-nz55kfq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161333-nz55kfq","updated":"20240613161337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161333-al0pe2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161333-al0pe2g","updated":"20240613161333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸甘。性平。有小毒。畏磁石及酒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161333-k43thjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161333-k43thjq","updated":"20240613161333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主小儿百二十种惊痫。螈癫疾。寒热肠痔。虫毒。蛇痫弄舌摇头。大人五邪。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161333-4p5r1no","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161333-4p5r1no","updated":"20240613161333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"言产难。目【归经】入肝经。为走窜之品。（兼轻剂能引诸药入肝散邪）【前论】寇氏曰。蛇蜕从口退出。眼睛亦退。今眼药及去翳膜用之。取此义也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161333-ved7aty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161333-ved7aty","updated":"20240613161333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【禁忌】经疏曰。小儿惊痫癫疾。非外邪客忤。而由肝心虚者。不效。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161102-tiui0ix","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161102-tiui0ix"}},{"ID":"20240613161324-nyxcpcx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161324-nyxcpcx","updated":"20240613161328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161324-x5yn75z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161324-x5yn75z","updated":"20240613161324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕甘咸治蛇痫，喉风目翳诸疮虫，肠痔蛊毒催难产，百种惊风救儿童。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161324-wlgnh2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161324-wlgnh2b","updated":"20240613161324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕皮也。无毒。主蛇痫摇头弄舌，癫疾螈 ，寒热诸 ，恶疮似癞癜风白驳，煎汁之。疮有脓者烧敷之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161324-0cx0y5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161324-0cx0y5p","updated":"20240613161324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肠痔蛊毒，妇人难产，小儿百二十种惊风，兼辟恶止呕。取石上白如银色完全者埋土中一宿，醋浸炙干，恶磁石及酒。疟疾用塞两耳，内服盐汤，引吐即止。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161102-v8xq0jl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161102-v8xq0jl"}},{"ID":"20240613161315-4mn5jm5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161315-4mn5jm5","updated":"20240613161319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161315-csg9mg6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161315-csg9mg6","updated":"20240613161315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"轻宣、去风毒．"}]},{"ID":"20240613161315-8i5pups","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161315-8i5pups","updated":"20240613161315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘咸．性灵而能辟恶．故治鬼魅蛊毒．性窜而善去风．故治惊痫风疟．重舌（圣惠方、烧末敷．）喉风．性毒而能杀虫．故治疥癣恶疮．疔肿痔漏．属皮而性善蜕．故治皮肤疮疡．产难目翳．用白色如银者．皂荚水洗净．或酒、或醋、或蜜浸．炙黄．或烧存性．或盐泥固．（小儿口紧、不能开合饮食、不语即死、烧灰敷、良．）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161102-rovtsib","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161102-rovtsib"}},{"ID":"20240613161306-jtiwr3b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161306-jtiwr3b","updated":"20240613161310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161306-t7vh1n6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161306-t7vh1n6","updated":"20240613161306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸甘，平，无毒。主小儿百二十种惊痫，螈 ，癫疾寒热，肠痔虫毒，蛇痫，弄舌摇头，大人五邪，言语僻越，恶疮呕咳，明目。火熬之良。一名石出子衣，一名蛇符，一名龙子皮，一名龙子单衣，一名弓皮。生荆州川谷及田野，五月五日、十五日取之良。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161102-f66z612","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161102-f66z612"}},{"ID":"20240613161242-8laoowd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161242-8laoowd","updated":"20240613161248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161242-w6v0nm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161242-w6v0nm7","updated":"20240613161242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕，端午采取，去翳膜，明澈双睛，止呕逆，辟除诸恶，大人肠痔蛊毒，小儿螈惊痫，火熬敷之，疮疹能愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161242-rsx3ife","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161242-rsx3ife","updated":"20240613161242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治（痘疹合参） 凡痘不论寒热虚实而不起发，用此焙干，配起发之药助之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161102-agg1c0c","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161102-agg1c0c"}},{"ID":"20240613161143-zdl4dju","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-zdl4dju","updated":"20240613161255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161143-g3t32yn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-g3t32yn","updated":"20240613161143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」蛇皮、蛇壳、龙退、龙子衣、龙子皮、弓皮、蛇符、蛇筋。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161143-6b7orxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-6b7orxj","updated":"20240613161143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」咸、甘、平、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161143-y54kwre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-y54kwre","updated":"20240613161143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240613161143-42i2589","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-42i2589","updated":"20240613161143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、喉痹肿痛。用蛇蜕烧研为末，乳汁送服一钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161143-kcaipku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-kcaipku","updated":"20240613161143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、缠喉风疾，呼吸困难。用蛇蜕（炙）、当归，等分为末。温酒送服一钱，得吐即为有效。又方：用蛇蜕揉碎烧出烟，由竹筒吸放喉内。又方；用蛇蜕裹白梅一枚噙咽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161143-e9kux6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-e9kux6s","updated":"20240613161143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、小儿重舌。用蛇蜕研末，调醋敷涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161143-s1n8iia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-s1n8iia","updated":"20240613161143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、小儿口紧（不能开合、不能饮食）。有蛇蜕烧灰敷口内（先将口洗净）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161143-bh8qaos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-bh8qaos","updated":"20240613161143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、小儿头面生疮。用蛇蜕烧灰，调猪油敷涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161143-3pwp1e6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-3pwp1e6","updated":"20240613161143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、小儿埕血，用蛇蜕烧灰，乳汁调服半钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161143-9qsh0tq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-9qsh0tq","updated":"20240613161143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、目生翳膜。有蛇蜕条，洗净，晒干剪细，和白面作成饼，炙成焦黑色，研为末。每服一钱，饭后服，温水送下。一天服二次。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161143-gczxr9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-gczxr9a","updated":"20240613161143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、小便不通。有全蛇蜕一条，烧存性，研为末，温酒送服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161143-l4ckmp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-l4ckmp8","updated":"20240613161143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、石痈无脓，坚硬如石。用蛇蜕贴痈上，过夜即变软易治。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161143-tchuleu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-tchuleu","updated":"20240613161143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、肿毒无头。用蛇蜕烧灰，调猪油涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161143-u99cz49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-u99cz49","updated":"20240613161143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11、恶疮似癞，年久不愈。用全蛇蜕一条烧灰，调猪油搽疮。另烧蛇蜕一条，温酒送服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161143-r1vwplg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161143-r1vwplg","updated":"20240613161143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12、白癜风。有蛇蜕烧灰，调醋涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161102-bw9hw1z","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161102-bw9hw1z"}},{"ID":"20240613161103-m143s2h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-m143s2h","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：蛇蜕"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-5jj9s3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-5jj9s3p","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-t7y5ywc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-t7y5ywc","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shé Tuì"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-tvbacyx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-tvbacyx","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-p6h359j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-p6h359j","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蛇皮、蛇退、长虫皮、龙衣、蛇壳"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-wl6fma7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-wl6fma7","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-v8o188n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-v8o188n","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" PERIOSTRACUM SERPENTIS"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-4v4kh5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-4v4kh5q","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-1k6zuji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-1k6zuji","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为游蛇科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黑眉锦蛇"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Elaphe taeniura Cope 、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"锦蛇"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Elaphe carinata （Guenther）或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乌梢蛇"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Zaocys dhumnades （Cantor）等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蜕下的干燥表皮膜"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。春末夏初或冬初采集，除去泥沙，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-alws7yd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-alws7yd","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-8upw4vp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-8upw4vp","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品呈圆筒形，多压扁而皱缩，完整者形似蛇，长可达1m以上。背部银灰色或淡灰棕色，有光泽，鳞迹菱形或椭圆形，衔接处呈白色，略抽皱或凹下；腹部乳白色或略显黄色，鳞迹长方形，呈覆瓦状排列。体轻，质微韧，手捏有润滑感和弹性，轻轻搓揉，沙沙作响。气微腥，味淡或微咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-wl9t4rg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-wl9t4rg","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-v1y2muy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-v1y2muy","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置干燥处，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-byxgh87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-byxgh87","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-xyokr1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-xyokr1e","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蛇蜕"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：除去杂质，切段。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-1p9t4cv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-1p9t4cv","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"酒蛇蜕"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：取蛇蜕段，照酒炙法（附录Ⅱ D）炒干。每100kg蛇蜕 ，用黄酒15kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-e3rm2pf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-e3rm2pf","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-he5vqzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-he5vqzq","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-ksfevfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-ksfevfc","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-yn53n6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-yn53n6s","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸、甘，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-9qumc29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-9qumc29","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-b0sgcd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-b0sgcd7","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 祛风，定惊，解毒，退翳。用于小儿惊风，抽搐痉挛，翳障，喉痹，疔肿，皮肤瘙痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-eihkzo2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-eihkzo2","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-c60s7n5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-c60s7n5","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 2～3g；研末吞服0.3～0.6g"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-d4g2to4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-d4g2to4","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-jhywp52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-jhywp52","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-b9anjpf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-b9anjpf","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：蛇蜕"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-qvfqluy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-qvfqluy","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-d40inc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-d40inc2","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shé Tuì"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-vg0m1gw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-vg0m1gw","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-yf2pnu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-yf2pnu1","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 龙子衣、蛇符、龙子单衣、弓皮（《本经》），龙皮、龙单衣、蛇筋、蛇附（《吴普本草》），蛇皮（《雷公炮炙论》），龙子皮（《别录》），蛇蜕皮（《药性论》），蛇壳、蛇退（《纲目》），龙衣（《分类草药性》），青龙衣（《浙江中药手册》），长虫皮（《河南中药手册》），白龙衣（《山西中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-man2s4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-man2s4r","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-2b9vjwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-2b9vjwp","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-ano0ztg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-ano0ztg","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-lbs75zu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-lbs75zu","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为游蛇科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黑眉锦蛇、锦蛇、乌梢蛇、赤链蛇"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等多种蛇"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蜕下的皮膜"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。全年皆可收集，但以3～4月间为最多。取得后抖去泥沙，晒干或晾干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-qkeputo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-qkeputo","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-a5z2obn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-a5z2obn","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主产浙江、广西、四川、江苏、福建、安徽、陕西、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-q4cka06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-q4cka06","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-x131f7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-x131f7h","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①黑眉锦蛇，详\"黄颔蛇\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-l8lz5y0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-l8lz5y0","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②锦蛇"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-g5dyjhi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-g5dyjhi","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全长可达1.8米。头部比颈部稍大。吻鳞宽大于高，从背面可以看到。鼻间鳞长宽略相等。前额鳞宽大于长，两鳞间的缝合线比鼻间鳞长。额鳞前方稍宽于后方。颅顶鳞宽大。前鼻鳞狭长，后鼻鳞宽广，鼻孔大，位于2鼻鳞之间而稍向后。眼前鳞2片，有时3片，极少为1片。眼后鳞2片。前颞鳞2片，狭长；偶有3片者。后颞鳞3片，短而宽。上唇鳞8片，第4、5两片入眼；第7片最大。颊鳞1片，偶有2片者。下唇鳞10片。前5片与前颏鳞相接。前颏鳞比后颏鳞大。体鳞23～23～19行，除最外1、2行鳞列光滑外，余都起棱。腹鳞215～226片，肛鳞2裂，尾下鳞84～101对。体背面及头部的鳞片四周黑色，中央黄色，体之前半部有30条左右较明显的黄色横斜斑纹，至体后半部消失，只在鳞片中央有黄斑。腹面黄色，有黑色斑纹。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-oao58s1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-oao58s1","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栖于高山及平原地区。性活拨，动作迅速。以其他蛇类为食，甚至吃自己的小蛇。亦食鸟类的蛋及鼠类。有奇臭，无毒。分布安徽、江苏、浙江、福建、台湾、广东、江西、湖北、四川、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-emf5dfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-emf5dfe","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③乌梢蛇，详\"乌蛇\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-09nhla9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-09nhla9","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④赤链蛇，详\"赤链蛇\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-x8eab7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-x8eab7h","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-af7sif1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-af7sif1","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥的蜕皮为圆筒形的半透明皮膜，常压扁或稍皱缩，或有碎断。完整者长达1米以上。背侧银灰色，有光泽具菱形或椭圆形的半透明鳞片。腹部乳白色或略显黄色，鳞片呈长方形，作覆瓦状排列。质轻柔，易破碎，抚之有滑润感。气微腥，味淡或微咸。以色白、皮细、条长、粗大、整齐不碎、无泥沙杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-eima80a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-eima80a","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-blot0ba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-blot0ba","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蛇蜕含骨胶原。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-2q706ff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-2q706ff","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-jr4wghv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-jr4wghv","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 用甘草水洗过，晒干，再用黄酒喷匀，置锅内微炒至黄色。（每蛇蜕100斤，用酒5斤）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-bb50xlj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-bb50xlj","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"火熬之良。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-o0hu6mi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-o0hu6mi","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《雷公炮炙论》：\"凡欲使，先于屋下以地掘一坑可深一尺二寸，安蛇皮于中一宿，至卯时出，用醋浸一时，于火上炙干用之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-x4sik8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-x4sik8q","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《纲目》：\"今人用蛇蜕，先以皂荚水洗净，缠竹上，或酒、或醋、或蜜浸，炙黄用。或烧存性，或盐泥固煅，各随方法。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-dylj6z4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-dylj6z4","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-d78i3ch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-d78i3ch","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草经疏》：\"入肝。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-99458re","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-99458re","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草再新》：\"入肝、脾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-g073muz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-g073muz","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-xiiknxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-xiiknxl","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘咸，平，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-mt9gc93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-mt9gc93","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味威，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-ioefw5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-ioefw5q","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"甘，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-12si924","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-12si924","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-bqtrlg2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-bqtrlg2","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-3xnps36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-3xnps36","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-mi9ez2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-mi9ez2l","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《药对》：\"畏慈石。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-z0onu7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-z0onu7a","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"孕妇忌用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-ks4f2ep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-ks4f2ep","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经疏》：\"小儿惊痫癫疾，非外邪客忤而由肝心虚者不效。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-6yj7at0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-6yj7at0","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-nd9rseh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-nd9rseh","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 祛风，定惊，退翳，消肿，杀虫。治小儿惊痫，喉风口疮，木舌重舌，目翳内障，疔疮，痈肿，瘰疬，腮腺炎，痔漏，疥癣。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-zt1mdc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-zt1mdc1","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主小儿惊痫瘈疭，癫疾，寒热，肠痔，虫毒蛇痫。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-e4kxcri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-e4kxcri","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"主弄舌摇头，大人五邪言语僻越，恶疮，呕咳，明目。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-tm3ldet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-tm3ldet","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"治喉痹。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-n89o2ty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-n89o2ty","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"止呕逆。治小儿惊悸客忤，催生，疬疡，白癜风。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-i2drxsw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-i2drxsw","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《用药心法》：\"去翳膜。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-l8j7wby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-l8j7wby","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《纲目》：\"祛风，杀虫。烧末服，治妇人吹奶，大人喉风，退目翳，消木舌，敷小儿重舌，重腭，唇紧，解颅，面疮，月蚀，天泡疮，大人疔肿，漏疮肿毒，煮汤洗诸恶虫伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-921uc9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-921uc9l","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《医林纂要》：\"缓肝保心，去毒热，除风湿。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-zj0geny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-zj0geny","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《分类草药性》：\"治眼胀头风，煅研涂疮，汤火伤，收湿疮干水，治疮疾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-srnrcy9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-srnrcy9","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-iyfirfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-iyfirfd","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，0.5～1钱；或研末为散。外用：煎汤洗涤或研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-72ls1po","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-72ls1po","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-oeg5qp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-oeg5qp3","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治小儿风痫惊热：蛇蜕皮三寸（炙），细辛（去苗叶，锉）、钩藤（锉）、黄芪（锉）、甘草（炙）各半两，大黄（蒸三度，锉，焙）一两，蚱蝉四枚（炙，去翅、头、足）。上粗捣筛。每服一钱匕，水八分，煎至四分，去渣，入牛黄少许搅匀，食后温服。（《圣济总录》蛇蜕汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-5gfc6fn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-5gfc6fn","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治缠喉风，咽中如束，气不通：蛇蜕（炙黄）、当归等分。为末，温酒调一钱匕，得吐愈。（《医准》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-vwd9eh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-vwd9eh2","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治小儿喉痹肿痛：蛇蜕烧末，乳汁服一钱匕。（《食医心镜》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-zbdqz6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-zbdqz6o","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治小儿吐血并重舌：烧蛇蜕皮末，以乳服之。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-plpr3am","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-plpr3am","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治小儿重腭重断肿痛，口中涎出：蛇蜕皮烧灰，研令细，以少许傅之。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-ruljxbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-ruljxbl","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治小儿口疮：蛇蜕，水渍令湿软，拭口内疮。（《圣济总录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-iq5wsgg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-iq5wsgg","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治白内障：蛇蜕一个，冰片二分，银朱一分。先将蛇蜕烧存性，后和其他药物共研细末。每日三次，每次放眼内少许。（内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-1x9fz42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-1x9fz42","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治痘毒目翳：蛇蜕二钱（为末），瓜蒌仁五钱（研烂）。上用羊肝一片批开，入药末二钱，线扎紧，用米泔煮熟，频与儿食。（《小儿痘疹方论》蛇蜕散）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-ck58eq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-ck58eq4","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治斑疹入眼，翳膜侵睛成珠子：马勃一两，皂荚子二七个，蛇退皮（全者）一条。上入小罐子内，封泥烧，不得出烟，存性，研为末。温水调下一钱，食后。（《小儿斑疹备急方论》蛇蜕散）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-sr3qw18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-sr3qw18","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治痈疽结鞕未成脓：蛇蜕烧灰细研，以醋调涂肿上，干即易。亦可只以蛇皮贴之。（《圣济总录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-07a3zl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-07a3zl4","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治儿吹著奶疼肿：蛇蜕一尺七寸，烧令黑，细研，以好酒一盏，微温顿服，未甚效更服。（《产乳集验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-60zyahe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-60zyahe","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治疔疮：㈠蛇蜕皮如鸡子大，以水四升，煮三、四沸，去渣，顿服。㈡烧蛇蜕皮灰，以鸡子清和涂之。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-keoy9ah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-keoy9ah","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治疔肿：蛇蜕皮一两半（白者），露蜂房半两，乱发一团如鸡子大（童子者妙）。上三味，锉碎于熨斗内烧灰，细研为散。每服二钱匕，空心米饮调下，盖覆出汗，更服。（《圣济总录》蛇蜕散）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-94yz403","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-94yz403","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治瘰疬溃后：蜜蜂二十一个，蛇蜕七分半，蜈蚣二条（端午前收者佳）。上用香油四两，将前三味入油，用文武火煠枯，捞去渣，入定粉二两，用如箸粗桑枝七条，急搅候冷，出火气七日夜，方用纸摊贴患处。（《医宗金鉴》蛇蜕膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-8ynhw7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-8ynhw7j","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治中耳炎：蛇蜕97％，小蜘蛛2％，冰片1％。共研细粉，瓶贮。先将耳内脓液洗净，吹入药粉，每日一次。（广西《中草药新医疗法处方集》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-k0r1pjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-k0r1pjp","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃治乳房肿胀、疼痛：蛇蜕、鹿角、露蜂房各三钱。共烧存性研细末。黄酒冲服。每日服二次，每次一钱。（《吉林中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-dq8savb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-dq8savb","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒄治漏疮血水不止：蛇皮（焙焦）、五倍子、龙骨各一钱半，续断五钱。上为末，入麝香少许，津唾调敷。（《丹溪心法》蛇蜕散）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-kgw86bl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-kgw86bl","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒅治癣疮：烧蛇蜕一具，酒服。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-2v3h7be","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-2v3h7be","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒆治小便不通：全蛇蜕一条。烧存性，研。温酒服之。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-yooxi7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-yooxi7x","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒇治乳糜尿：龙衣一市尺。放瓦上焙干，研细末。加适量红糖冲服，一日一剂。（徐州《单方验方新医疗法选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-pa4iej8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-pa4iej8","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（21）治蛲虫：蛇蜕二钱（焙黄），冰片一分。共研细末。临睡前抹肛门处。（《吉林中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-zw1qj37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-zw1qj37","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（22）治小儿解颅：熬蛇蜕皮，末之，和猪颊车中髓，敷顶上，日三、四度。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-h8kxwv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-h8kxwv2","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-124gk7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-124gk7e","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疗脑囊虫病"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-xdw20vf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-xdw20vf","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将蛇蜕研成细粉，开水送服，每次1钱，日服2次。同时配服大戟汤（槟榔2两、大戟1钱、木瓜6钱、钩藤4钱，头晕加菊花4钱，有肝炎者去槟榔加雷丸6钱，加水500毫升，煎成150毫升，每日2次，每次50毫升，可连服30剂左右）。据10余年来千余例的观察，大多在用药后3～4个月内出现效果：脑压迫症状（抽搐、失明、失语、头痛等）减轻，结节减少或消失；用药1年以上，有的病人症状可完全消失，坚持服药2年以上的可收到更好的效果。其中250例经1年以上治疗，结果显效38例（15.2％），有效160例（64％），无效50例（20％），死亡2例（0.8％）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-wt04ip8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-wt04ip8","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗流行性腮腺炎"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-bildcit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-bildcit","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取蛇蜕2钱（成人及12岁以上儿童用量加倍），洗净切碎，加2个鸡蛋搅拌，用油炒熟（可加盐），1次服用。90例患者除5例服2剂外，均只服1剂，结果81％的病例于治疗2日内腺肿消退。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-j623qed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-j623qed","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治疗淋巴腺结核"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-063ucd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-063ucd7","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取蛇蜕3～6克（剪碎），鸡蛋3个。先将鸡蛋打一小孔，流去蛋白，留下蛋黄，然后于每个鸡蛋内装入蛇蜕1～2克，用纸糊口。置火中烤熟，去壳内服。每服1个，每日3次服完。治疗6例，服药70～90天均获痊愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-ca3g9wr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-ca3g9wr","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治疗麦粒肿"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-1w9g5h6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-1w9g5h6","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将完整的蛇蜕置于陈酸醋内浸泡，数日后取出剪成约5×8毫米的小块，贴敷局部，上盖浸有酸醋的棉片，固定，24小时换药1次，至痊愈为止。30例患者（30只眼）经1～3次治疗后，27例痊愈。经1年多随访，尚无1例复发。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-drnhdcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-drnhdcs","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治疗中耳炎"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-5ud6ri3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-5ud6ri3","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将蛇蜕烧灰研末，调以麻油。用时先以双氧水洗净患耳，擦干后用棉棒蘸药涂于患部，每日或隔日1次。治疗21例，19例痊愈。亦有用蛇蜕、蜂窝各3钱，浸于95％酒精300毫升中，7天后过滤滴耳，每日3～4次。治疗慢性化脓性中耳炎4例，均于1周内见效。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-pae2osy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-pae2osy","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，用蛇蜕与鸡蛋混合，煎成蛋饼内服，治疗颈痈有显著效果。用蛇蜕、急性子制成片剂，每日顿服10片（每片含蛇蜕0.09钱，急性子0.045钱），连服30～45天，对马来丝虫病有防止流火发作或减少发作次数及减轻症状的作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-qgrqhq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-qgrqhq7","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-l0r1i68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-l0r1i68","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经疏》：\"蛇蜕，入肝而辟恶，小儿惊痫，瘈疭，颓疾寒热，蛇痫弄舌摇头，大人五邪，言语僻越，皆肝经为病，蛇蜕能引诸药入肝散邪，故主如上等证。善能杀虫，故主肠痔虫毒恶疮。邪去木平，故止呕咳明目。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-yghtljw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-yghtljw","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-9r64t4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-9r64t4j","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-0hets25","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-0hets25","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：蛇蜕"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-hnygoil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-hnygoil","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-k1oz1g1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-k1oz1g1","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shé Tuì"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-anj8ls4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-anj8ls4","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-i8pv0mz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-i8pv0mz","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 龙子衣、蛇符、龙子单衣、弓皮、 龙皮、龙单衣、蛇筋、蛇附、蛇皮、龙子皮、蛇退、蛇壳、龙退、龙衣、青龙衣、长虫皮、白龙衣"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-919biai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-919biai","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-x201q8f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-x201q8f","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Snake Slough"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-10m34j7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-10m34j7","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-a4vtmg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-a4vtmg1","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-390xld0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-390xld0","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-wfcxkv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-wfcxkv8","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为游蛇科动物王锦蛇、红点锦蛇、黑眉锦蛇等多种蛇蜕下的皮膜。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-v3pl6ph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-v3pl6ph","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Elaphe carinata (Guenther) 2.Elaphe rufodorsata(Cantor)3.Elaphe taeniurus Cope"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-bcj3eou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-bcj3eou","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全年均可收集。以4月-10月间为最多，拾得后抖净泥沙，晾干即可。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-x1fy9yg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-x1fy9yg","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-u5fdr1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-u5fdr1o","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.生活于山区及丘陵地带，平原亦有分布。性子猛，行动迅速。以蛙、鸟、蜥蜴等为食。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-5hb33rs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-5hb33rs","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生活在海拔60-700m的河流、湖泊、池塘、田野等处，多于晴天活动。以鱼、蛙、蝌蚪为食。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-c0576lg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-c0576lg","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于西南、华中及陕西、甘肃、江苏、安徽、浙江、江西、福建、广东、广西、台湾。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-spyta37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-spyta37","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于东北、华东及河北、山西、河南、湖北。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-xmttrkj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-xmttrkj","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-xiap8dw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-xiap8dw","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.王锦蛇，体粗状，全长2m左右。全身黑色，杂以黄色花斑，形似菜花，体前部有若干黄色横纹，头背棕黄色，鳞缘黑色，散以黑色斑，在尾下形成黑色纵纹。眶前鳞1，其下方常有1-2枚小鳞，眶后鳞2（3）；颞鳞2（3、1）+3（2、4），上唇鳞3-2-3式，背鳞23（25）-23（21）-19（17）行，除最外1-2行平滑，余均具强棱；腹鳞203-224；肛鳞2分，尾下鳞69-102对。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-terormn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-terormn","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.红点锦蛇，半水栖蛇类，全长约1m。体背面淡红褐色，具4条深棕色纵纹，直达尾末端，在体前段或断或续，头部有三道深棕色“∧”形斑，腹面黄棕色，密布黑色方斑，腹鳞外侧与背鳞交界处有不规则的黑点；尾腹面正中具黑纵纹，或无斑。眶前鳞1，眶后鳞2，颞鳞2（1、3）+3（2、1）；上唇鳞2-2-3式，或3、2、3（2、2、2）式。背鳞平滑，21（19-23）-21（19）-17（15）行；腹鳞162-186；肛鳞2分；尾下鳞47-64对。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-dahummj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-dahummj","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.黑眉锦蛇参见“黄颔蛇”条。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-ilr5g7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-ilr5g7v","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-9xh27z0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-9xh27z0","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别，本品呈圆筒形，多压扁、皱缩、破碎，完整者形似蛇，长可达1m以上。背部银灰色或淡棕色，有光泽，具菱形或椭圆形鳞迹，鳞迹衔接处呈白色，略抽皱或凹下；腹部乳白色或略显黄色，鳞迹长方形，呈覆瓦状排列。体轻，质微韧，手捏有润滑感或弹性，轻轻搓揉，沙沙作响。气微腥，味淡或微咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-gqdj7nu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-gqdj7nu","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-79vkk2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-79vkk2l","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.王锦蛇蜕下的干燥表皮膜，含骨胶原（collagen），血清中含抗毒因子，相对他子质量为6700左右的酸性蛋白质。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-tndposg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-tndposg","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.渔游蛇（Natrix piscator）的干膜含骨胶原，氨基酸，糖原（glycogen），核酸，氨肽酶（aminopeptidase），及β-葡萄糖醛酸酶（β-glucuronidase），乳酸脱氢酶，异柠檬酸脱氢酶，二及三磷酸吡啶核苷酸黄递酶（di\u0026triphosphopyridinenucleotide diaphorase），酯酶，葡萄糖-6-磷酸脱氢酶，磷酸化酶。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-kseg4vc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-kseg4vc","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-is5jz38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-is5jz38","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.抗炎症作用： 采用煮沸的蛇蜕水提取物，冻干后得黄褐色粉末，得率为5.4%，用消炎痛（Indomethacin，IDM）、保秦松（Phenylbutazone，PB）作为对照药物。动物采用雄性大鼠（2009-300g体重）和dd系雄性小鼠（20g）。饲料、水自由摄取。实验结果表明：1.1.急性毒性试验无明显的毒性。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-kb6695f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-kb6695f","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.2.对白血球游走的抑制作用表明：提取液20mg/kg 静脉注射，抑制率约51.1%（P＜0.01），每天口服 200mg/kg，5天抑制率为33.7%（P＜0.02）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-bziojxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-bziojxn","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.对足跖浮肿的抑制作用：对角叉菜胶所致浮肿的抑制作用，口服无效。50mg/kg 皮下注射和20mg/kg静脉注射呈现与IDM同等显着的抗浮肿作用。给发炎剂后，静脉注射20mg/kg 2小时后出现明显的抗浮肿作用。对芥末糊（Mus-tarol）所致浮肿的抑制作用，IDM在7天后有抑制浮肿的作用，蛇蜕提取液从第6天开始有效，但与保泰松一样都无持续抗浮肿作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-1ekmybu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-1ekmybu","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.对血管通透性亢进的抑制作用：剂量为100mg/kg口服对葡聚糖所致皮肤浮肿抑制率60%（P＜0.02）。 口服对照药物IDM10mg/kg抑制率为37.5%（P＜0.01），但对色素扩散的抑制率，提取液仅为15%（P＜0.05），IDM则为72.6%（P＜0.01），这表明两种药物的作用机理不同。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-7n5ba4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-7n5ba4g","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.对红血球热溶血的抑制作用：提取液4mg 和12mg的抑制作用分别为20.5%（P＜0.01）和48%（P＜0.01）；相当于IDM1mg，保泰松5mg对溶血的抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-5f3fj8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-5f3fj8t","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-3oz053w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-3oz053w","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 用甘草水洗过，晒干，再用黄酒喷匀，置锅内微炒至黄色。(每蛇蜕100斤，用酒5 斤)1.《本经》：火熬之良。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-k1judmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-k1judmb","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《雷公炮炙论》：凡欲使，先于屋下以地掘一坑可深一尺二寸，安蛇皮于中一宿，至 卯时出，用醋浸一时，于火上炙干用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-uds19kb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-uds19kb","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《纲目》：今人用蛇蜕，先以皂荚水洗净，缠竹上，或酒、或醋、或蜜浸，炙黄用。 或烧存性，或盐泥固煅，各随方法。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-yxfy8pg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-yxfy8pg","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-gj9608t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-gj9608t","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-q5ga1mh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-q5ga1mh","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-by1lovz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-by1lovz","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味甘；咸；性平"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-kwhiq49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-kwhiq49","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-u56rnji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-u56rnji","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-7mcxo28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-7mcxo28","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-01rq9f7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-01rq9f7","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 祛风；定惊；退翳；止痒；解毒消肿。主惊痫抽搐；角膜翳障；风疹瘙痒；喉痹；口疮；龈肿；聤耳；痈疽；疔毒；瘰疬；恶疮；烫伤"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-oplfvqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-oplfvqd","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-uy4sksc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-uy4sksc","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3-6g；研末，每次1.5-3g。外用：适量，煎汤洗；研末撒或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-vscyqtt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-vscyqtt","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-e8stgrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-e8stgrl","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治小儿风痫惊热： 蛇蜕皮三寸(炙)，细辛(去苗叶，锉)、钩藤(锉)、黄芪(锉) 、甘草(炙)各半两，大黄(蒸三度，锉，焙)一两，蚱蝉四枚(炙，去翅、头、足)。上粗捣筛 。每服一钱匕，水八分，煎至四分，去渣，入牛黄少许搅匀，食后温服。(《圣济总录》蛇 蜕汤)②治缠喉风，咽中如束，气不通： 蛇蜕(炙黄)、当归等分。为末，温酒调一钱匕， 得吐愈。(《医准》)③治小儿喉痹肿痛： 蛇蜕烧末，乳汁服一钱匕。(《食医心镜》)④治小儿吐血并重舌： 烧蛇蜕皮末，以乳服之。(《千金方》)⑤治小儿重腭重断肿痛，口中涎出： 蛇蜕皮烧灰，研令细，以少许傅之。(《圣惠方》)⑥治小儿口疮： 蛇蜕，水演令湿软，拭口内疮。 (《圣济总录》)⑦治白内障： 蛇蜕一个，冰片二分，银朱一分。先将蛇蜕烧存性，后和其他药物共研细末 。每日三次，每次放眼内少许。(内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》)⑧治痘毒目翳蛇蜕二钱(为末)，瓜蒌仁五钱(研烂)。上用羊肝一片批开，人药末二钱，线扎 紧，用米泔煮熟，频与儿食。(《小儿痘疹方论》蛇蜕散)⑨治斑疹人眼，翳膜侵睛成珠子： 马勃一两，皂荚子二七个，蛇退皮(全者)一条。上入小 罐子内，封泥烧，不得出烟，存性，研为末。温水调下一钱，食后。(《小儿斑疹备急方论》蛇蜕散)⑩治痈疽结鞕未成脓： 蛇蜕烧灰细研，以醋调涂肿上，干即易。亦可只以蛇皮贴之。(《 圣济总录》)11.治儿吹着奶疼肿： 蛇蜕一尺七寸，烧令黑， 细研，以好酒一盏，微温顿服，未甚效 更服。(《产乳集验方》)12.治疔疮：一、蛇蜕皮如鸡子大，以水四升，煮三、四沸，去渣，顿服。二、烧蛇蜕皮灰 ，以鸡子清和涂之。(《千金方》)13.治疔肿： 蛇蜕皮一两半(白者)，露蜂房半两，乱发一团如鸡子大(童子者妙)。上三味 ，锉碎于熨斗内烧灰，细研为散。每服二钱匕，空心米饮调下，盖覆出汗，更服。(《圣济 总录》蛇蜕散)14.治瘰疬溃后： 蜜蜂二十一个， 蛇蜕七分半，蜈蚣二条(端午前收者佳)。上用香油四 两，将前三味入油，用文武火煠枯，捞去渣，入定粉二两，用如箸粗桑枝七条，急搅候冷，出火气七日夜，方用纸摊贴患处。(《医宗金鉴》蛇蜕膏)15.治中耳炎： 蛇蜕97%，小蜘蛛2%，冰片 1绍。共研细粉，瓶贮。先将耳内脓液洗净， 吹入药粉，每日一次。(广西《中草药新医疗法处方集》)16.治乳房肿胀、疼痛： 蛇蜕、鹿角、露蜂房各三钱。共烧存性研细末。黄酒冲服。每日 服二次，每次一钱。(《吉林中草药》)17.治漏疮血水不止： 蛇皮(焙焦)、五倍子、龙骨各一钱半，续断五钱。上为末，入麝香 少许，律唾调敷。(《丹溪心法》蛇蜕散)18.治癣疮： 烧蛇蜕一具，酒服。(《千金方》)19.治小便不通： 全蛇蜕一条。烧存性，研。温酒服之。(《纲目》)20、治乳糜尿： 龙衣一市尺。放瓦上焙干，研细末。加适量红糖冲服，一日一剂。(徐州 《单方验方新医疗法选编》)21.治蛲虫： 蛇蜕二钱(焙黄)，冰片一分。共研细末。临睡前抹肛门处。(《吉林中草药 》)22.治小儿解颅： 熬蛇蜕皮，末之，和猪颊车中髓，敷顶上，日三、四度。 (《千金方 》)"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-ir9turv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-ir9turv","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-05l7kbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-05l7kbk","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.治疗脑囊虫病：将蛇蜕研成细粉，开水送服，每次 1钱，日服2次。同时配 服大戟汤(槟榔2两、大戟1钱、木瓜6钱、钩藤4钱，头晕加菊花4钱，有肝炎者去槟榔加雷丸 6钱，加水500ml，煎成150ml，每日2次，每次50ml，可连服30剂左右)。据10余年来千余例的观察，大多在用药后3-4个月内出现效果：脑压迫症状(抽搐、失明、失语、头 痛等)减轻，结节减少或消失；用药1年以上，有的病人症状可完全消失，坚持服药2年以上的可收到更好的效果。其中250例经1年以上治疗，结果显效38例(15.2%)，有效160例(64%)，无效50例(20%)，死亡2例(0.8%)。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-vrnr7ev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-vrnr7ev","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.治疗流行性腮腺炎：取蛇蜕2钱(成人及12岁以上儿童用量加倍)，洗净切碎力口2个鸡蛋搅拌，用油炒熟(可加盐)，1次服用。90例患者除5例服2剂外，均只服1剂，结果81%的病例于治疗2日内腺肿消退。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-0h5u3tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-0h5u3tr","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.治疗淋巴腺结核： 取蛇蜕3-6g(剪碎)，鸡蛋3个。先将鸡蛋打一小孔，流去蛋白，留下蛋黄，然后于每个鸡蛋内装入蛇蜕 1-2g，用纸糊口。置火中烤熟，去壳内服。每跟 1个 ，每日3次服完。治疗6例，服药70-90天均获痊愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-929d4zo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-929d4zo","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.治疗麦粒肿：将完整的蛇蜕置于陈酸醋内浸泡，数日后取出剪成约5×8mm的小块，贴敷局部，上盖浸有酸醋的棉片，固定，24小时换药1次，至痊愈为止。30例患者（30只限）经 1-3次治疗后，27例痊愈。经1年多随访，尚无1例复发。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-onotcsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-onotcsk","updated":"20240613161108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.治疗中耳炎：将蛇蜕烧灰研末，调以麻油。用时先以双切冰洗净患耳，擦干后用棍棒蘸 药涂于患部，每日或隔日1次。治疗21例，19例痊愈。亦有用蛇蜕、峰窝各3钱，浸于95%酒 精300ml中，7天后过滤滴耳，每日3-4次。治疗慢性化脓性中耳炎4例，均于1周内见效 。此外，用蛇蜕与鸡蛋混合，煎成蛋讲内服，治疗颈痈有显着效果。用蛇蜕、急性子制成片剂，每口顿服10片(每片含蛇蜕0.09钱，急性子0.045钱)，连服30-45天，对马来丝虫病有防止流火发作或减少发作次数及减轻症状的作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-7b4oi5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-7b4oi5h","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613161103-sle92j1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161103-sle92j1","updated":"20240613161103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613161105-ba0yqgh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613161105-ba0yqgh"}},{"ID":"20240613161106-2zvr6ov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613161106-2zvr6ov"}}]}